     <P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体></FONT></SPAN> </P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT color=#ff0000 face=宋体>4月份研究院将组织<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>年绍兴市直教学研究评比活动，包括优质课评比、录像课评比和教学论文评比，请各学科组落实参评人选，积极准备。具体事项如下：</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT color=#ff0000 face=宋体>一、市直优质课评比</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT color=#ff0000 face=宋体>1.时间：4月份。具体时间请与学科教研员联系。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体><FONT color=#ff0000>2.参加人选：请学科组长今天下班前将推荐参加优质课评比人选报课程处，并</FONT><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT color=#ff0000 face="Times New Roman">将参评教师名单电话告知相关学科教研员。</FONT></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT color=#ff0000 face="Times New Roman">二、录像课评比</FONT></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT color=#ff0000 face="Times New Roman">1.时间：4月20号前把相关参评材料报送学科教研员</FONT></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT color=#ff0000 face="Times New Roman">2.主题：上课内容请与教研员联系</FONT></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT color=#ff0000>3.人选：每学科一人参加评比</FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT color=#ff0000 face="Times New Roman">三、教学论文评比</FONT></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT color=#ff0000 face="Times New Roman">1.时间：4月28号之前将相关材料提交课程处</FONT></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT color=#ff0000 face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">四、具体准备材料等相关要求见以下转发通知。</SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"></SPAN></FONT></SPAN> </P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; COLOR: black; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 华文中宋; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"><FONT face="Times New Roman">绍兴市教育教学研究院<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
