<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 23pt; TEXT-INDENT: 35.15pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">一、教学论文评比<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
