<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体"><FONT face="Times New Roman">（二）录像课评比<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>教学要求</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>课堂教学需立足课程标准的基本要求，体现</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">“</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>品质智慧课堂</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">”</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>的七个要素：关注学科素养、关注学习状况、关注学习趣乐、关注问题思辨、关注实践体验、关注资源技术和关注学习效果。尤其要突显数字化教育资源的课堂应用，转变学教方式，为学生的深度学习提供支架和辅助，为教师的精准教学提供工具和数据，依托人工智能和大数据分析有效解决课堂教学的重难点问题。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">评比形式<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体"><FONT face="Times New Roman">录像课评比即为“一师一优课、一课一名师”活动，各校所提交的“品质智慧课堂”录像课评比材料应包括以下四项材料：一堂完整课的教学设计、所用课件及相关资源（或资源链接）、课堂实录（指教学过程视频）和评测练习（可选）等。课堂实录应展现课堂教学的所有内容，过程完整，画面清晰。建议进行适当的后期剪辑处理，在适当环节插入教学资源呈现画面，保证资源呈现画面清晰。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">评比时间。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体"><FONT face="Times New Roman">各校参评选手名单（见附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）及相关参评材料<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>包括教学设计、所用课件及相关资源、课堂实录和评测练习<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>需刻录在同一光盘，一式两份<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN>须在<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>日前报本院相关学科教研员。评比主题及要求由学科教研员根据省教研室“一师一优课、一课一名师”活动的总体安排确定并通知。各学科根据工作要求组织评比，并将评比结果在评比活动结束后一周内报送课程教研中心。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><FONT face="Times New Roman"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; LETTER-SPACING: 0.75pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体">评选科目及取奖数量上限<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体"><FONT face="Times New Roman">各校各学科推荐<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>节“品质智慧课堂”录像课参加评比，各学科一、二等奖的比例为<SPAN lang=EN-US>4:6</SPAN>。</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P></SPAN></FONT></SPAN> </P>
<P><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA'><FONT face=宋体><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; mso-hansi-font-family: 楷体; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋; mso-font-kerning: 0pt"></SPAN> </P></FONT></SPAN>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
